  "note": "AD-136 (research tree v2, owner 2026-09-23): the town hall's levels II-VI need the «Ратуша» branch (town_hall.N); the laboratory, school and warehouse need their level-I node; the engineering office has five levels (max_level). The mill, stoneworks, carpentry shop and expedition office open on a side node (milling.2, masonry.3, carpentry.3) or cartography.3, and their levels II-VI need their parent building at that level (requires_building, the parent's working level). No building may be raised above the town hall's level (BuildingTiers). Supersedes docs/addenda/v0.7/data/building_progression.json.",
